    {
      "n": 2,
      "sourceEntry": 130,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I’m sure it will. I don’t want you to feel I’m making any demands on you. If there’s one thing I’ve learned in fifteen years of marriage, it’s not to make demands.",
